&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In the AI Security Benchmark Series:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Part 1:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://ofriperetz.dev/articles/i-let-claude-write-60-functions-65-75-had-security-vulnerabilities" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;I Let Claude Write 80 Functions. 65-75% Had Security Vulnerabilities.&lt;/a&gt; — Establishes the baseline vulnerability rate&lt;/li&gt;
