&lt;strong&gt;Part 2:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://ofriperetz.dev/articles/the-ai-hydra-problem-fix-one-ai-bug-get-two-more" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;The AI Hydra Problem: Fix One AI Bug, Get Two More&lt;/a&gt; — Tests whether remediation converges&lt;/li&gt;
